<title>USA: Brinker International Inc Q3 EPS flat.</title>
<headline>Brinker International Inc Q3 EPS flat.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>					    (Unaudited)</p>
<p>			  13 Weeks Ended	 39 Weeks Ended</p>
<p>		     March 26  March 27   March 26  March 27</p>
<p>			  1997	1996	 1997	1996</p>
<p>Revenues	    $345,510  $284,206   $965,099  $863,322</p>
<p>Net Income	   $13,332   $13,869    $41,356   $15,895</p>
<p>Primary</p>
<p>Net Income</p>
<p>Per Share	     $0.18     $0.18	$0.53     $0.21</p>
<p>Primary Weighted</p>
<p>Average Shares</p>
<p>Outstanding	  75,704    78,389     78,163    77,421</p>
<p>Note: The company said its Q3 97 earnings were negatively impacted by non-recurring severance costs and interest charges related to the debt incurred to fund the company's stock repurchase plan.</p>
<p>((--Wall St Desk, 212-859-1721))</p>
